OMNeT++ Experiment 23
Title: Cellular Protocol Analysis with Wireshark (GSM, GTP, S1AP, NGAP)

Description:
Generates a simplified protocol event sequence for cellular control and tunnel messages for protocol-analysis learning.

Project source files:
- Experiment_23.ned  (NED network and simple module)
- Experiment_23.cc   (C++ simulation module)
- omnetpp.ini           (simulation configuration)

Run in an installed OMNeT++ project:
  opp_makemake
  make
  ./Experiment23Network -u Cmdenv -f omnetpp.ini

NOTE: Graph and console images in this folder are prepared demonstration artifacts.
Run this project in OMNeT++ to obtain environment-specific simulation logs and vectors.
